WEBVTT

00:00:05.190 --> 00:00:08.190
Dr. Liger Shishioh has arrived from the U.S...

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:12.570
...bringing with him a cutting-edge A.I. robot powered by the GS-Ride.

00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:15.570
But unexpectedly, the robot escapes!

00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:21.200
The name of this mysterious robot who appears before Mamoru is...

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:28.210
Mic Sounders the 13th!

00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:32.010
The U.S. has poured all of its resources into developing this...

00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:35.050
...ultra-high-powered CR-number robot!

00:00:36.510 --> 00:00:39.140
See Mic racing bravely to meet the enemy head-on!

00:00:39.680 --> 00:00:41.890
Oh, no!

00:00:42.310 --> 00:00:44.390
Help me!

00:00:48.230 --> 00:00:50.980
But the truth is, Mic is a real wimp.

00:00:51.280 --> 00:00:53.900
Oh boy. Oh gosh. Oh my.

00:00:54.360 --> 00:00:56.320
Well, well... instead of "casting pearls before swine"...

00:00:56.450 --> 00:00:59.370
...we've cast the G-Stone before my brother Liger!

00:01:01.160 --> 00:01:04.870
Until the protection device I built is removed...

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:09.340
The 13th's true power can never be unleashed!

00:01:11.170 --> 00:01:14.170
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:01:14.170 --> 00:01:17.070
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:01:17.930 --> 00:01:23.850
King of Braves GaoGaiGar

00:01:24.420 --> 00:01:28.070
Rise in fury, Steel Cyborg!

00:01:30.190 --> 00:01:34.790
With your red mane and golden arms!

00:01:36.110 --> 00:01:39.070
Your G-Stone sparkling in the sun...

00:01:39.070 --> 00:01:43.990
All the world's hope is in your hands.

00:01:43.990 --> 00:01:47.910
Your time has come to make a stand!

00:01:47.910 --> 00:01:50.710
Crushing the hopes of the people...

00:01:50.710 --> 00:01:54.470
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:01:56.620 --> 00:01:59.470
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:01:59.470 --> 00:02:02.640
The Zonders will pay the price!

00:02:02.640 --> 00:02:05.180
Final Fusion, approved!

00:02:05.380 --> 00:02:08.310
Now transform into a superhero!

00:02:08.310 --> 00:02:11.270
Warping dimensional space!

00:02:11.520 --> 00:02:15.350
Dividing Driver!

00:02:17.170 --> 00:02:22.990
A miracle! A mystery! The truth! A dream!

00:02:22.990 --> 00:02:28.870
A gigantic, invincible guardian is born!

00:02:28.870 --> 00:02:31.820
Our very own King of Braves!

00:02:31.820 --> 00:02:35.710
Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:02:35.130 --> 00:02:37.720
This is the story of the brave men and women...

00:02:37.840 --> 00:02:40.720
...who fight with all their hearts to save mankind.

00:02:43.100 --> 00:02:43.140
Protection Disabled!

00:02:44.350 --> 00:02:45.930
<i>Protection Disabled!</i>

00:02:48.350 --> 00:02:50.730
Whoa! This place is really big, huh?

00:02:51.310 --> 00:02:53.060
The Big Order Room is big, big...

00:02:53.270 --> 00:02:54.440
Humongous, man!

00:02:54.570 --> 00:02:57.190
I bet it's as big as 12 Mt. Fujis!

00:02:57.740 --> 00:02:59.360
Actually, it's not quite as big as that.

00:02:59.450 --> 00:03:02.910
Oh! I was just exaggerating a little, see!

00:03:03.410 --> 00:03:05.080
Allow me to introduce you once again.

00:03:05.280 --> 00:03:07.540
This robot has traveled to the GGG from the USA along with Dr. Liger...

00:03:07.620 --> 00:03:09.160
...on his technology transfer mission...

00:03:09.250 --> 00:03:11.290
His name is Mic Sounders the 13th!

00:03:11.420 --> 00:03:13.750
Yay! I'm so glad to meet you!

00:03:13.920 --> 00:03:14.960
Nice to meet you, too!

00:03:15.090 --> 00:03:16.960
I'm the captain of the Mobile Unit. My name's Gai!

00:03:17.090 --> 00:03:18.800
And I'm Special Agent...

00:03:18.880 --> 00:03:20.630
Oh! Your name is Mamoru!

00:03:20.760 --> 00:03:22.640
I remember you all right!

00:03:22.840 --> 00:03:23.930
Waha!

00:03:24.350 --> 00:03:27.390
You know what, I had no idea you were a robot from America!

00:03:27.520 --> 00:03:31.140
At NASA we're on a constant mission to protect the planet.

00:03:31.270 --> 00:03:33.230
Though you're not quite up to GGG standards yet.

00:03:33.350 --> 00:03:36.770
Well, we have to plan for world peace, not just peace in Japan!

00:03:36.860 --> 00:03:39.280
Sure, but anybody can just plan to do something.

00:03:39.440 --> 00:03:42.570
We have the facilities to mass-produce the Pliers!

00:03:42.660 --> 00:03:45.200
Quantity isn't everything, you know!

00:03:45.320 --> 00:03:48.950
Let's introduce GGG's robots and leave the old fogies to their bickering.

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:51.750
<i>You have no right calling ME an old geezer!</i>

00:03:51.830 --> 00:03:53.620
Never mind them, let's move on...

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:57.630
My name is HyoRyu, I'm a vehicle robot with the Mobile Unit.

00:03:57.880 --> 00:03:59.710
Huh? HyoRyu?

00:04:00.010 --> 00:04:02.630
That would be "Ice Dragon" in English!

00:04:02.840 --> 00:04:05.300
That really sounds good to eat!

00:04:05.550 --> 00:04:09.220
And I'm EnRyu, I'm HyoRyu's twin vehicle robot.

00:04:09.390 --> 00:04:12.480
Ah! So you two are twin brothers, huh?

00:04:13.020 --> 00:04:15.900
We stay in vehicle form when we're not on duty.

00:04:16.150 --> 00:04:18.400
We've got an A.I. system geared for search and rescue...

00:04:18.520 --> 00:04:20.610
...as well as exceptional mobility.

00:04:21.240 --> 00:04:22.990
You're a rescue team, eh?

00:04:23.490 --> 00:04:24.990
But that's not all!

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:27.740
System Change!

00:04:36.540 --> 00:04:40.710
We're also armed to the teeth with weapons better than the military's!

00:04:42.010 --> 00:04:45.300
I've got a Melting Gun and Rifle for heat attacks.

00:04:45.640 --> 00:04:48.930
And I have a Freezing Gun and Rifle, for ice attacks.

00:04:51.850 --> 00:04:54.310
We can also transform into semi-vehicle form.

00:04:54.810 --> 00:04:57.690
By using magazines...

00:04:57.810 --> 00:04:59.360
...we can equip pencil launchers.

00:05:04.240 --> 00:05:05.990
Chest Thriller!

00:05:07.490 --> 00:05:11.330
In addition, I use the thermal dial on my chest to launch my Chest Thriller.

00:05:13.620 --> 00:05:15.250
Mirror Shield!

00:05:16.210 --> 00:05:19.250
And I've got a Mirror Shield to repel enemy attacks.

00:05:19.380 --> 00:05:21.170
Amazing power, guys!

00:05:21.340 --> 00:05:23.380
Wait, there's still more!

00:05:24.090 --> 00:05:26.430
We undergo something called Symmetrical Docking...

00:05:26.550 --> 00:05:30.350
...to transform into a giant robot called ChoRyuJin.

00:05:31.890 --> 00:05:35.980
ChoRyuJin!

00:05:36.100 --> 00:05:37.270
I didn't see that coming!

00:05:37.440 --> 00:05:40.570
And there's a weapon that only ChoRyuJin can wield...

00:05:40.650 --> 00:05:42.110
...the ultimate megaton tool...

00:05:42.280 --> 00:05:46.070
...that instantly extinguishes flames and explosions, the Eraser Head!

00:05:47.110 --> 00:05:51.330
No one but ChoRyuJin can withstand the recoil of the Eraser Head!

00:05:53.620 --> 00:05:58.420
Wow, GGG's robots are very, very strong! I get it now!

00:05:58.500 --> 00:06:00.540
It's still too soon to be blown away, Mic!

00:06:00.630 --> 00:06:01.540
What?

00:06:01.670 --> 00:06:04.710
GGG's robots aren't just powerful, you know.

00:06:04.800 --> 00:06:07.550
They each have their own special abilities to match their respective jobs.

00:06:07.880 --> 00:06:11.050
What kind of abilities? Tell me! Tell me! Please!

00:06:11.300 --> 00:06:13.220
Volfogg, why don't you tell him?

00:06:13.560 --> 00:06:14.720
Very well.

00:06:15.100 --> 00:06:18.730
Then allow me to explain what my unique abilities are.

00:06:20.560 --> 00:06:24.110
I use my Melting Siren to dismantle the Zonders' barrier system.

00:06:24.980 --> 00:06:26.820
I have the ability to bend light, and to disappear by...

00:06:26.940 --> 00:06:30.620
...blending into my surroundings, this is called Holographic Camouflage.

00:06:32.910 --> 00:06:35.580
System Change!

00:06:37.500 --> 00:06:41.460
I hurl a Mirror-Coated boomerang at the enemy, the Silver Moon.

00:06:41.880 --> 00:06:45.800
If I combine two of them, I double their velocity for the Silver Cross.

00:06:46.710 --> 00:06:48.130
Fog Gas!

00:06:50.300 --> 00:06:52.180
I can create multiple illusionary images of myself inside a fog...

00:06:52.300 --> 00:06:53.970
...using the Projection Beam.

00:06:56.310 --> 00:06:59.940
My Multidimensional Link Sys enables me to control consolidated circuits.

00:07:00.440 --> 00:07:02.230
Incredible!

00:07:02.520 --> 00:07:04.610
You haven't heard the best part yet!

00:07:05.480 --> 00:07:08.990
Let me explain the GunMachines belonging to GGG Intelligence.

00:07:10.360 --> 00:07:13.490
One GunMachine transforms from bike mode, GunDober.

00:07:14.740 --> 00:07:17.910
He is a mecha designed for land warfare, heavily armed.

00:07:24.920 --> 00:07:28.010
The other transforms from helicopter mode, GunGlue.

00:07:28.260 --> 00:07:31.090
He is designed for aerial attacks, and specializes in close combat.

00:07:35.720 --> 00:07:37.520
Three Become One!

00:07:45.020 --> 00:07:48.400
And when the two GunMachines and I combine...

00:07:48.530 --> 00:07:50.740
...we become Big Volfogg who is armed with...

00:07:50.860 --> 00:07:52.740
4,000 Magnum!

00:07:53.860 --> 00:07:56.200
Murasame Sword!

00:07:57.910 --> 00:08:00.910
I am fully protected from enemy fire or even explosions...

00:08:01.120 --> 00:08:03.170
...thanks to my on-board Mirror Coating.

00:08:04.750 --> 00:08:07.960
My finishing move involves hurling mirror-coated particles at high speed...

00:08:08.090 --> 00:08:10.380
...the Whirling Death Strike.

00:08:10.840 --> 00:08:13.090
And while still under the effects of Mirror Coating I am...

00:08:13.220 --> 00:08:16.600
...able to confuse the enemy by splitting and re-docking repeatedly...

00:08:16.720 --> 00:08:18.720
...this is called the Deadly Art of the Body-split.

00:08:29.780 --> 00:08:31.320
Wonderful!

00:08:31.440 --> 00:08:34.570
You're a great robot, Mr. Volfogg!

00:08:34.700 --> 00:08:37.120
Hey! I hope you haven't forgotten about me!

00:08:37.240 --> 00:08:38.660
Goldymarg!

00:08:38.870 --> 00:08:42.250
I'm a multi-robot, built with the latest technological advances of...

00:08:42.370 --> 00:08:43.410
...all the GGG robots.

00:08:43.540 --> 00:08:46.830
I've got specs that blow the rest of these guys away!

00:08:47.040 --> 00:08:47.750
Oh, right!

00:08:47.840 --> 00:08:50.460
You're the one who waltzed through the cyclone I couldn't manage to fly in!

00:08:50.590 --> 00:08:53.220
That powerful robot!

00:08:53.630 --> 00:08:56.260
I'm not so sure about his robot specs being better...

00:08:56.430 --> 00:08:59.430
...but it's true that Goldymarg has a very special job to do.

00:08:59.560 --> 00:09:03.230
Hey Mic, just wait 'til you hear what Goldymarg can do!

00:09:03.350 --> 00:09:04.810
Huh! Guess I have no choice.

00:09:04.980 --> 00:09:07.610
Okay, then, I'll try to explain in simple words you can understand.

00:09:09.570 --> 00:09:12.610
First off, there's my vehicle mode, Goldytank!

00:09:12.900 --> 00:09:14.530
Thanks to my Super-bit Drive...

00:09:14.650 --> 00:09:17.110
...I have no problem climbing up the steepest slopes!

00:09:17.820 --> 00:09:20.620
I'm equipped with a fusion-energy beam, the Marg Cannon!

00:09:21.490 --> 00:09:23.790
System Change!

00:09:32.510 --> 00:09:37.300
Goldymarg!

00:09:37.720 --> 00:09:41.140
When I'm in robot mode, I'm absolutely indestructible.

00:09:41.810 --> 00:09:44.930
And since I've got unlimited access to the power of the GS-Ride...

00:09:45.180 --> 00:09:47.810
...no one in the world can match my mobility!

00:09:48.900 --> 00:09:51.690
System Change!

00:09:53.400 --> 00:09:55.740
Lastly, I have a Tool Mode, the Marg Hand...

00:09:56.200 --> 00:09:58.660
...and the Goldion Hammer.

00:10:00.870 --> 00:10:04.580
Combined with GaoGaiGar, our power is close to unlimited!

00:10:08.500 --> 00:10:11.630
Goldion Hammer!

00:10:12.040 --> 00:10:15.460
Able to convert all forms of matter into particles of light...

00:10:15.550 --> 00:10:17.760
It's the most powerful Hyper Tool in the world!

00:10:18.680 --> 00:10:22.140
Wah! This is so astounding my head's starting to spin!

00:10:22.600 --> 00:10:25.100
Well, it's not all astounding.

00:10:25.220 --> 00:10:28.850
Since my A.I. System was patterned after Major Hyuuma...

00:10:28.980 --> 00:10:30.860
...you can't really say it's good quality.

00:10:31.060 --> 00:10:32.610
What did you just say?

00:10:32.770 --> 00:10:35.860
And don't forget the Pliers my big brother sent us.

00:10:35.990 --> 00:10:38.700
Oh, yeah, aren't those coming in handy for you people?

00:10:39.070 --> 00:10:41.370
Yes, I don't know what we'd do without them.

00:10:45.580 --> 00:10:48.120
Tool Connect!

00:10:53.630 --> 00:10:55.710
Thanks to the ability of the Pliers to repair spatial rifts...

00:10:55.800 --> 00:10:57.670
...and the little ways in which they support me...

00:10:57.800 --> 00:11:00.300
...they've saved the day for GaoGaiGar time and time again.

00:11:00.430 --> 00:11:02.260
Uh-huh, haven't they though?

00:11:02.390 --> 00:11:05.350
By the way, what kind of powers does Mic have?

00:11:05.560 --> 00:11:07.520
Well, um let's see, he can fly!

00:11:07.640 --> 00:11:09.890
He can't fly without Baribarien, can he now?

00:11:10.230 --> 00:11:12.810
I'm totally useless.

00:11:12.900 --> 00:11:14.690
Hey, that's not true, Mic!

00:11:14.820 --> 00:11:17.530
Sure, there are robots who might only do odd jobs...

00:11:17.690 --> 00:11:22.570
...but they help to keep us in good spirits, like Piggy there.

00:11:22.740 --> 00:11:25.080
Oh! You're such a lovely thing, Piggy!

00:11:25.700 --> 00:11:28.080
We're gonna be good friends, aren't we?

00:11:30.580 --> 00:11:32.920
My heart's starting to pound!

00:11:33.670 --> 00:11:36.340
Uh-oh, I really need to get home soon!

00:11:37.380 --> 00:11:40.340
Hmm, then why don't we have Mic take you home, Mamoru?

00:11:40.470 --> 00:11:42.970
Oh! That means I can be useful, right?

00:11:43.090 --> 00:11:44.220
Waha!

00:11:44.430 --> 00:11:47.810
Just one thing, you're a classified robot from the United States, Mic...

00:11:47.970 --> 00:11:49.850
...so try not to attract too much attention to yourself, all right?

00:11:49.980 --> 00:11:51.100
Okay!

00:11:51.440 --> 00:11:54.100
Baribarien, on!

00:12:15.170 --> 00:12:16.540
Waha!

00:12:17.000 --> 00:12:19.550
The sunset's pretty huge, isn't it?

00:12:19.920 --> 00:12:22.380
Well, I wanted to hang out with you a little longer...

00:12:22.470 --> 00:12:24.300
...so I took the long way home, you know.

00:12:24.390 --> 00:12:26.390
Isn't Dr. Liger going to be mad at you?

00:12:26.550 --> 00:12:27.930
You're my friend, Mamoru.

00:12:28.010 --> 00:12:31.140
I just want to spend time with my friend!

00:12:32.270 --> 00:12:33.730
Friends, huh?

00:12:34.060 --> 00:12:36.730
I guess you're right. It's good to have friends!

00:12:37.230 --> 00:12:39.020
Curatio!

00:12:39.980 --> 00:12:43.570
If everyone finds out that I have a power like that...

00:12:43.820 --> 00:12:45.910
...I wonder if they'll still be my friends?

00:12:48.120 --> 00:12:51.910
I want to be friends with you forever, you know!

00:12:52.040 --> 00:12:53.960
Really? Then, you've got to promise, okay?

00:12:54.080 --> 00:12:54.920
Okay!

00:12:55.040 --> 00:12:57.670
Mamoru and Mic are gonna be friends forever!

00:12:57.750 --> 00:12:58.920
Promise! Promise!

00:12:59.040 --> 00:13:00.340
Waha!

00:13:00.420 --> 00:13:02.720
Hey, Mic, let's hang out a little longer!

00:13:02.800 --> 00:13:05.800
Waha! okay, you've got it!

00:13:15.600 --> 00:13:19.400
Are you all present, my Four Machine Kings?

00:13:19.900 --> 00:13:22.530
Yes, we're all present and accounted for, Lord Pasdar.

00:13:22.690 --> 00:13:25.150
Our Zonder Metal supply is dwindling.

00:13:25.320 --> 00:13:28.530
Just as we expected, we will need to build a giant Zonder Plant.

00:13:29.070 --> 00:13:32.240
But I believe our first order of business should be pest control.

00:13:32.370 --> 00:13:35.290
In particular, I have misgivings about that child.

00:13:35.660 --> 00:13:40.630
Pizza, I hope you realize what a threat that child is to us Zonderians.

00:13:40.790 --> 00:13:42.250
I know...

00:13:42.550 --> 00:13:45.090
Of course I know that, Penchinon.

00:13:45.760 --> 00:13:47.010
Very well.

00:13:47.260 --> 00:13:52.260
Before building the plant, we shall eliminate the Legacy of Cain.

00:14:01.980 --> 00:14:04.610
GGG Battle Records, attempt access.

00:14:04.690 --> 00:14:06.780
Password input...

00:14:10.030 --> 00:14:12.330
Voiceprint confirmed.

00:14:13.200 --> 00:14:16.370
Volfogg, Code Number G09.

00:14:16.540 --> 00:14:19.540
Now accessing the GGG Battle Records.

00:14:23.130 --> 00:14:27.930
Access successful. Now copying the GGG Battle Records.

00:14:28.840 --> 00:14:30.220
EI-02.

00:14:30.840 --> 00:14:32.930
Garbage-amalgam Robot.

00:14:33.220 --> 00:14:35.930
Destroyed by Hell and Heaven Attack.

00:14:37.850 --> 00:14:39.810
EI-03.

00:14:40.400 --> 00:14:43.820
Iron Ball Machine Robot, destroyed by the same attack.

00:14:44.190 --> 00:14:46.400
Ditto, EI-04.

00:14:47.190 --> 00:14:49.400
Steam Locomotive Robot.

00:14:50.950 --> 00:14:52.490
Ditto, EI-05.

00:14:52.950 --> 00:14:55.950
The Zonder host was also the host for EI-04, transforming...

00:14:56.080 --> 00:14:57.620
...into a Space Shuttle Robot.

00:14:58.620 --> 00:15:00.250
EI-06.

00:15:01.040 --> 00:15:02.130
A Trailer Robot...

00:15:02.250 --> 00:15:07.170
...destroyed by combined efforts of GaoGaiGar, HyoRyu, and EnRyu.

00:15:08.260 --> 00:15:11.050
Tanker Robot, EI-07.

00:15:15.510 --> 00:15:19.890
Caused gasoline explosion, thwarted by ChoRyuJin's Eraser Head...

00:15:20.060 --> 00:15:22.520
...which dispelled the energy from the blast.

00:15:23.230 --> 00:15:27.150
The 300-Series Shinkansen Robot, EI-08.

00:15:27.280 --> 00:15:32.200
Destroyed by a two-pronged Eraser Head with Hell and Heaven attack.

00:15:32.990 --> 00:15:36.580
The Airship Robot that enveloped the entire sky over Tokyo...

00:15:36.990 --> 00:15:38.540
...EI-09.

00:15:40.210 --> 00:15:43.750
Destroyed by an internal Hell and Heaven Attack.

00:15:44.540 --> 00:15:46.920
Continuing the copy process...

00:15:48.420 --> 00:15:51.340
EI-10, a Bike Robot.

00:15:51.840 --> 00:15:54.220
EI-11, a Deep-Sea Submersible Robot.

00:15:54.600 --> 00:15:57.430
EI-12, a Particle Accelerator Robot.

00:15:57.970 --> 00:16:01.100
EI-13, a Rollercoaster Robot.

00:16:01.890 --> 00:16:05.020
EI-14, a Military Transport Plane Robot.

00:16:05.560 --> 00:16:08.730
EI-15, a GGG Mecha Parts Robot.

00:16:09.320 --> 00:16:12.400
EI-16, a Long-range Cannon Robot...

00:16:13.160 --> 00:16:16.070
EI-17, a Tire Robot...

00:16:16.580 --> 00:16:20.250
EI-18, a Micro-Machine Amalgam...

00:16:20.830 --> 00:16:23.920
EI-19, a Science Lab Robot...

00:16:24.500 --> 00:16:27.960
EI-20, a Gravity Control Device Robot...

00:16:28.500 --> 00:16:32.090
EI-21, a B-52 Bomber Robot...

00:16:32.760 --> 00:16:35.550
EI-22, a Weather-tracking Satellite Robot...

00:16:37.350 --> 00:16:40.350
Copying process complete. Now powering down.

00:16:49.610 --> 00:16:53.110
Mic... What could he be up to?

00:17:06.580 --> 00:17:07.750
All right!

00:17:12.050 --> 00:17:17.510
All records of GGG activity during 2-0-0-5.

00:17:17.890 --> 00:17:19.050
Nice going!

00:17:19.180 --> 00:17:20.970
Now all I have to do is bring back a...

00:17:21.060 --> 00:17:23.680
...sample of you-know-what without anybody noticing!

00:17:31.860 --> 00:17:33.990
I'll be home by 8 o'clock, okay?

00:17:34.530 --> 00:17:37.660
Don't go anywhere with strangers, all right?

00:17:38.030 --> 00:17:40.530
Sure, don't worry! We're all going together!

00:17:40.910 --> 00:17:42.790
Okay, then, see you later!

00:17:42.910 --> 00:17:45.500
Don't forget to call before you come home!

00:17:45.620 --> 00:17:46.870
Okay!

00:17:47.500 --> 00:17:48.460
Now, Ai.

00:17:48.540 --> 00:17:49.630
Honey!

00:17:50.210 --> 00:17:53.550
If you're that worried, you should've just gone with him.

00:17:53.630 --> 00:17:56.840
But he said he'd be embarrassed to have his mother along...

00:17:56.970 --> 00:18:00.760
...since he was going with all the other children!

00:18:00.890 --> 00:18:03.060
Mamoru's all grown up now, huh?

00:18:03.140 --> 00:18:05.060
No, he's still just a little boy.

00:18:05.890 --> 00:18:09.810
Just like kids have to learn to be independent of their parents...

00:18:09.940 --> 00:18:12.730
...parents have to learn to let go of their kids, too.

00:18:12.900 --> 00:18:15.070
It's still too soon for that!

00:18:15.320 --> 00:18:18.820
He's our little treasure, given to us by that North Pole lion...

00:18:18.950 --> 00:18:21.240
...but when he grows up, he's going to leave the nest.

00:18:21.370 --> 00:18:25.200
And that's part of the natural cycle of life.

00:18:25.290 --> 00:18:28.370
I want him to stay a little boy just a while longer.

00:18:28.710 --> 00:18:35.210
We may not be related by blood, but even so, that boy is what we live for!

00:18:46.430 --> 00:18:49.520
Come on! Don't pull so hard!

00:18:51.270 --> 00:18:54.020
What's the matter, Yoseph?

00:19:01.950 --> 00:19:04.620
Oh, hey. What do you know, it's Kaidou!

00:19:04.790 --> 00:19:07.120
What are you doing? Waiting for somebody?

00:19:08.620 --> 00:19:10.750
Aren't you going to see the Electric Light Parade?

00:19:10.870 --> 00:19:12.130
We're all going!

00:19:13.790 --> 00:19:16.960
Kaidou, come with us! You'll have fun!

00:19:17.420 --> 00:19:19.880
We'd better hurry or we'll miss it!

00:19:23.350 --> 00:19:27.310
The G-Park 3rd Anniversary event is about to reach its climax!

00:19:27.430 --> 00:19:30.480
The Electric Light Parade is going to start right now!

00:19:34.980 --> 00:19:36.530
Oh, great! We made it!

00:19:36.650 --> 00:19:37.440
Hana!

00:19:37.530 --> 00:19:40.650
Well, now! How unusual for you to show up, Kaidou!

00:19:41.820 --> 00:19:43.490
Yeah! It's gonna start now!

00:19:56.500 --> 00:19:58.880
Oh! It's beautiful!

00:19:59.130 --> 00:20:01.550
Do you think Mamoru's around here somewhere, too?

00:20:01.970 --> 00:20:03.840
Why don't we look for him afterwards?

00:20:04.590 --> 00:20:07.760
Hi! Mic is very, very happy tonight!

00:20:08.140 --> 00:20:11.230
Should a top-secret robot be showing himself in a parade?

00:20:11.350 --> 00:20:12.690
Oh, my God!

00:20:12.770 --> 00:20:15.400
Dr. Liger's going to bawl him out again over this!

00:20:15.560 --> 00:20:17.650
I think I'm starting to feel feverish.

00:20:17.730 --> 00:20:19.940
Then I'll go get some ice cream.

00:20:20.070 --> 00:20:21.070
Is vanilla okay?

00:20:21.190 --> 00:20:22.570
Oh, yes!

00:20:22.860 --> 00:20:23.700
How about you, Swan?

00:20:23.780 --> 00:20:26.320
Oh! I'd like a swirl, please!

00:20:26.410 --> 00:20:27.160
Okay!

00:20:28.080 --> 00:20:30.080
Gai is such a sweet boy.

00:20:30.370 --> 00:20:32.460
Maybe I'll ask him to be my boyfriend!

00:20:32.580 --> 00:20:33.370
No you don't!

00:20:33.540 --> 00:20:34.670
Hey, I'm just kidding!

00:20:34.790 --> 00:20:38.210
I'm not interested in younger guys, anyway.

00:20:42.720 --> 00:20:44.380
Hey! It's Mic!

00:20:44.590 --> 00:20:46.180
Hey, everybody!

00:20:46.300 --> 00:20:49.220
It's me, Mic Sounders the 13th!

00:20:49.720 --> 00:20:52.180
And I'm everybody's friend, you know!

00:20:52.310 --> 00:20:55.560
Friend! Friend! Let's all have some fun together!

00:21:00.650 --> 00:21:02.110
There he is.

00:21:02.240 --> 00:21:04.110
The boy with green hair!

00:21:13.160 --> 00:21:13.870
No!

00:21:17.920 --> 00:21:18.960
I'm not gonna make it!

00:21:43.940 --> 00:21:45.280
W-What's going on?

00:21:55.580 --> 00:21:56.670
What is this?

00:21:56.830 --> 00:21:59.960
First that strange robot and now that child...

00:22:00.380 --> 00:22:05.380
Did he sense my presence and launch a psychokinetic attack on me?

00:22:09.300 --> 00:22:12.390
That robot just now, it couldn't be...

00:22:12.640 --> 00:22:13.470
It couldn't be!

00:22:13.680 --> 00:22:15.520
That was a calculated sound wave.

00:22:15.640 --> 00:22:18.520
A sound-pressure attack...

00:22:23.400 --> 00:22:24.480
But why?

00:22:24.820 --> 00:22:28.570
How did the protection get disabled?

00:22:28.780 --> 00:22:29.910
It's not possible...

00:22:30.030 --> 00:22:31.120
...so how?

00:22:37.290 --> 00:22:38.710
ID confirmed.

00:22:38.830 --> 00:22:41.790
As I figured, that robot is...

00:22:46.410 --> 00:22:50.310
You come floating down onto my planet.

00:22:51.510 --> 00:22:55.180
That's the dream I always have.

00:22:56.580 --> 00:23:01.360
Now you're looking up at the sky again...

00:23:01.360 --> 00:23:06.150
and you're searching for me.

00:23:06.780 --> 00:23:10.320
Longing to see you and be with you...

00:23:11.490 --> 00:23:17.250
I know I feel it just as strongly as you.

00:23:19.310 --> 00:23:24.010
When you and I are grown up...

00:23:24.010 --> 00:23:28.670
someday in the Sea of Stars.

00:23:29.360 --> 00:23:34.010
Give us the wings to fly

00:23:34.010 --> 00:23:40.910
and set off into the galaxy.

00:23:45.730 --> 00:23:48.940
Now releasing the latest intelligence.

00:23:49.110 --> 00:23:51.700
The ultrasound attack unleashed by a team of two Zonder Robos...

00:23:51.780 --> 00:23:56.830
...is about to destroy GaiGar, HyoRyu, EnRyu, Volfogg and Goldymarg!

00:23:56.910 --> 00:24:00.000
Time to System Change, Mic Sounders the 13th!

00:24:00.250 --> 00:24:03.120
No one but you can play that sweet melody of victory!

00:24:03.540 --> 00:24:05.540
Next episode of GaoGaiGar, King of Braves...

00:24:05.670 --> 00:24:06.750
"The Voice of Destruction."

00:24:06.630 --> 00:24:06.670
The Voice of Destruction

00:24:06.880 --> 00:24:10.470
Make sure you stay tuned for the order..."Final Fusion Approved!"

00:24:12.430 --> 00:24:15.680
Disc 'Power'

00:24:13.300 --> 00:24:14.970
This is the Key to Victory!
